{"5055340":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Lord of the Grind","steam_appid":5055340,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5145250],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lord of The Grind is <strong>a single-player 2D Action RPG focused on dungeon grinding, resource gathering, loot, crafting and long-term character progression.<\/strong><br><strong><\/strong><br><strong><\/strong><br><u><strong>BUILD YOUR POWER. CONQUER THE DUNGEON<\/strong><\/u><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on challenging dungeon floors with 9 completely unique characters, each offering a distinct way to play and progress.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character progression lies at the heart of your adventure, giving you countless ways to grow stronger and shape your journey. Push deeper into dangerous dungeons, hunt for valuable loot, gather resources, and craft powerful items to further enhance your character.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you prefer to actively battle your way to the depths of the dungeon or sit back and enjoy the rewards of AFK grinding, the choice is yours.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your character. Discover your playstyle. Grow stronger. And see how far you can go.<strong><\/strong><br><strong><\/strong><br><strong><\/strong><br><u><strong>FEATURES<\/strong><\/u><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time Action RPG combat<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon-based progression<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot-driven character progression<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessory and equipment system<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgradeable Core Power system<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Long-term character progression<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"b